<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Ala al-Dawla Bozkurt</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">d. <a href="/years/1515">1515</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/16th-century">16th century</a> · Also known as Alaüddevle Bozkurt Bey</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Ala al-Dawla Bozkurt was bey of the Dulkadirids, the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/turkmen">Turkmen</a> principality around <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/elbistan">Elbistan</a> and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kahramanmaras">Maraş</a>, from 1480 to 1515. He balanced between the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ottoman-empire">Ottomans</a> and the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mamluk">Mamluks</a> and fought the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/safavid-empire">Safavids</a>, but after <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/selim-i">Selim I</a>'s victory at Chaldiran he was defeated and killed by the Ottomans at Turnadağ in 1515, after which the principality came under Ottoman control.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/ala-al-dawla-bozkurt.jpg" alt="Ala al-Dawla Bozkurt" width="320" height="549" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Unknown author · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Akkoyunlu_Elvend_Mirz%C3%A2%E2%80%99n%C4%B1n_Ala%C3%BCddevle_Bey%E2%80%99in_huzuruna_gelmesi_(cropped).png" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
